<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#assertion_about_01524> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme promotes the normalization of violence as a response to infidelity, which can encourage dangerous behavior and contribute to a culture of aggression. The visual of a concealed handgun combined with the context of betrayal creates a potentially harmful message."@en .
