_:neaf6236668de4515a50e7bd4bdc8f68db82 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:neaf6236668de4515a50e7bd4bdc8f68db83 .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#CosmicIrony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text highlighting the absurdity or ironic nature of the visual situation in memes"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'when you catch your goat with another man' uses the deictic pronoun 'you', which directly projects the user (the viewer) onto the role of the person who discovers the infidelity. The user is positioned as the observer or actor in the scenario described, making them the subject of the action. This projection is onto the textual material, as the deictic 'you' is part of the text_chunk."@en .
