<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#OverallIntent> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimensionIndex> "9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person depicted is mapped as the 'goat' (a romantic partner) who has been caught with another man, based on the text overlay. The visual of them concealing a handgun suggests they are the subject of the retaliation, implying the audience is viewing this from the perspective of the betrayed partner."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#EntityOcclusion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
