<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#threat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is one of aggression and potential violence, conveyed through the visual of a person concealing a handgun and the textual context of infidelity leading to retaliation. The posture and grip on the weapon suggest an imminent or prepared threat."@en .
