<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#concealed_weapon_threat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image of a person concealing a handgun behind their hip is a visual trope often associated with danger, aggression, or impending violence. This is a common cinematic and media representation used to signal a threat, and understanding this visual convention is necessary to interpret the meme's implied escalation of conflict."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#concealed_weapon_threat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person in casual attire (black hoodie and blue jeans) is holding a handgun concealed behind their hip, suggesting a threatening or retaliatory action. The framing focuses on the weapon and the act of concealment, emphasizing the potential for violence."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VerbalIrony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Verbal Irony"@en .
