<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#infidelity_metaphor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phrase 'goat' is a colloquial term used to refer to a romantic partner, especially in the context of betrayal or infidelity. This is a common idiom in many cultures, particularly in African American Vernacular English (AAVE), where 'goat' can mean 'a man who is a romantic partner or lover'. Understanding this metaphor is essential to interpret the meme's context of jealousy and retaliation."@en .
